OL,3,GNEWSAYouth centre celebrates #238k
OL,4,Alottery windfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FA community centre has secured #238,740
OL,7,Ffrom the National Lottery Community
OL,8,FFund to expand its support for children
OL,9,Fand young people.
OL,11,FThe funding will enable Hill Street
OL,12,FYouth and Community Centre in Rugby to
OL,13,Flaunch a four-year programme later this
OL,14,Fmonth, designed to give young people
OL,15,Fmore opportunities to learn new skills,
OL,16,Fbuild confidence and spend time
OL,17,Ftogether.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,355,350,200,160,0,100
