OL,3,GNEWSAYouth centre celebrates #238k
OL,4,Alottery windfall
OL,5,
OL,6,FNew free activities will be introduced
OL,7,Fat the centre as part of the
OL,8,FRugby:THRIVE project, including a
OL,9,Fchildren's club on Tuesdays and an open
OL,10,Faccess youth club on Fridays.
OL,12,FDevelopment officer Chris Maddox
OL,13,Fdescribed the grant as "incredible",
OL,14,Fand said it came at a vital time for
OL,15,FRugby as the town was "struggling".
